<h2>12. How do I write a schema contract for highly unstructured web pages?</h2>
<p>For unstructured pages, such as blog posts or raw editorial content, focus schema constraints on structural bounds rather than rigid formatting: mandate <strong>title</strong> (string, minLength: 5), <strong>body_markdown</strong> (string, minLength: 100), and <strong>author</strong> (optional string).</p>

